```

The overlay is a full-screen absolute element toggled with its display style, and the same SetPaused method is used by Escape and the Resume button so they cannot get out of sync. Input and button clicks keep working while paused because UI Toolkit and the legacy Input use unscaled time. Restart and Quit reset Time.timeScale to 1 before changing scene so the next scene does not start frozen.

